                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a good game. I remember playing it for the longest time with my friends back in the day...\n\nOne thing. If your menu is sluggish then go to Options -> Advanced video -> Max Frame Rate\nset it to some actual frame rate like 60-70 fps, if you leave it on no limit depending on your GPU it might try to get way too many fps at be slow instead...\n\nP.S. And driving is as weird as I remember it too... it is supposed to be RC car, so light and easy to flip, so hitting a small rock or landing slightly unevenly might completely screw you over... though getting better wheels helps with that if you were wondering...",
